{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42145","headline":"江舍人宅筵上有妓唱和州韩舍人歌辞因以寄 · 徐铉","name":"江舍人宅筵上有妓唱和州韩舍人歌辞因以寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良宵丝竹偶成欢，中有佳人俯翠鬟。\n白雪飘颻传乐府，阮郎憔悴在人间。\n清风朗月长相忆，佩蕙纫兰早晚还。\n深夜酒空筵欲散，向隅惆怅鬓堪斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}